  "instructions": [
    "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the German sausage and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the sausage from the skillet and set aside.",
    "Add the chopped onion, bell pepper, potato, and carrot to the skillet and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 10 minutes.",
    "Add the mustard, chicken broth, salt, and black pepper to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Return the sausage to the skillet and simmer until the liquid has thickened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley or thyme, if desired.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
